{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" %}
{# What an NPC has been doing away from the player: a dismissed follower, a homed NPC who never followed, or a story subject (followed with no home; sever_story_place is where their days were last set). #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% if actor and actor.UUID %}
{% set is_fol = is_follower(actorUUID) or is_sever_follower(actorUUID) != "" %}
{% set was_follower = sever_was_follower(actor.UUID) != "" %}
{% set home_loc = default(sever_home(actor.UUID), "") %}
{% set story_place = sever_story_place(actor.UUID) %}
{# Homed NPCs who never followed get off-screen life too (CheckOffScreenLifeEvents
   walks every tracked actor with a home), so they qualify alongside former
   followers, and story subjects with them. sever_was_follower alone would hide their stories. #}
{% if not is_fol and (was_follower or home_loc != "" or story_place != "") %}
{% set event_history = sever_life_event_history(actor.UUID) %}
{% set life_summary = sever_life_summary(actor.UUID) %}
{% if event_history != "" or life_summary != "" %}

## What You've Been Up To
{% if not was_follower and home_loc != "" %}
Lately you've been living in {{ home_loc }}.
{% elif not was_follower %}
Lately your days have been spent around {{ story_place }}.
{% elif home_loc != "" %}
Since you and {{ player.name }} parted ways, you've been living in {{ home_loc }}.
{% else %}
Since you and {{ player.name }} parted ways, you've been on your own.
{% endif %}
{% if event_history != "" %}
Your recent days:
{{ event_history }}
{% elif life_summary != "" %}
Recently: {{ life_summary }}
{% endif %}

These are your own memories; you lived them. Bring one up when the talk turns that way, with {{ player.name }} or anyone else, but never recite the list. The ones marked significant or notable stayed with you most.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}